{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"搅坏眼前的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思转去替对方高兴，提醒自己，真心盼对方好这件事本身就让他开心。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心盼对方好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"想确认自己是否特别的紧张暂时退了，他不再计较给了多少，也不怕显得更在乎，觉得自己还有许多心意可给。\",\n      \"key\": \"许多心意可给\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"可他反而更怕眼前的亲近很快过去，想把这一刻留住，又怕给对方压力，刚放开的热情便收了回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"这一刻留住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是把这阵轻松当成保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去眼前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想保护已有快乐、不愿把喜欢变成催促的意思，改成他具体担心追问会搅坏眼前亲近；对方未承诺什么的边界也保留。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的关系原则改成他当下转移心思、靠真心盼对方好来安抚自己，保留给予本身确实能带来快乐的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并重复的投入增加，保留确认焦虑确实退下、不再计较也不怕显得更在乎。另明确退去的是想确认自己是否特别的紧张，反而更强的是怕眼前亲近很快过去的舍不得；想留住这一刻又怕给对方压力，解释B2、B3、B4中的情绪打开后收回、抓紧与酸楚并存。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把真实但暂时的轻松误当成保证的错误信念，明确这是他当时的过度确信，为S05再次想被看见、继而难堪提供直接前提。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3f580cc-53e3-41c3-ba88-254565480707", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223832802606Z", "elapsed_seconds": 451.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:46:03.975263+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd1209c18ca7ff2f9922928e5dcb66f6a49192e27c5c56f96fe10a765df1a3c5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safecha